Overture Maps places

The facts whose fact source is "overture" (some names, websites, phones and
addresses, and the name and location of Overture candidate places) come from
the places theme of Overture Maps Foundation (https://overturemaps.org). Open Camping DB takes
them from Overture's monthly releases, matches them to its own places and uses
them only where OpenStreetMap and the other sources give no value. The places
theme is made from the sources below, each under its own licence. The lines
are Overture's own attribution for the theme, copied from
https://docs.overturemaps.org/attribution/ on 15 November 2026:

